            <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd">
<html><body><div class="home-page"><!--First Section Start-->
<div class="about-us section" id="about">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 align-self-center">
<div class="left-image"><img alt="" src="../img/site/68599e6d7a8111003119203a.jpg"></div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-7 col-lg-7">
<div class="grow-network-text">
<div class="section-heading">
<h2>Networking l&agrave; n&#7873;n t&#7843;ng ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n doanh nghi&#7879;p th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng</h2>
</div>

<div class="lineleft">&nbsp;</div>

<div class="section-text">
<p>Kinh doanh th&ocirc;ng qua Networking &#273;&atilde; ch&#7913;ng minh l&agrave; m&#7897;t trong nh&#7919;ng c&aacute;ch hi&#7879;u qu&#7843; nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7875; ki&#7871;n t&#7841;o C&#417; h&#7897;i Kinh doanh v&agrave; t&#259;ng tr&#432;&#7903;ng doanh thu.</p>

<p>82% ch&#7911; doanh nghi&#7879;p cho bi&#7871;t ph&#7847;n l&#7899;n doanh thu c&#7911;a h&#7885; &#273;&#7871;n t&#7915; c&aacute;c l&#7901;i gi&#7899;i thi&#7879;u. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, h&#7847;u h&#7871;t kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; c&aacute;ch th&#7913;c &#273;&aacute;ng tin c&#7853;y &#273;&#7875; nh&#7853;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&aacute;c L&#7901;i gi&#7899;i thi&#7879;u n&agrave;y m&#7897;t c&aacute;ch th&#432;&#7901;ng xuy&ecirc;n.</p>

<p>BNI Vi&#7879;t Nam cung c&#7845;p m&#7897;t h&#7879; th&#7889;ng marketing th&ocirc;ng qua c&aacute;c C&#417; h&#7897;i kinh doanh &#273;&#7871;n t&#7915; nh&#7919;ng l&#7901;i gi&#7899;i thi&#7879;u &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7913;ng minh gi&uacute;p b&#7841;n ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n doanh nghi&#7879;p c&#7911;a m&igrave;nh, th&ocirc;ng qua m&#7897;t m&#7841;ng l&#432;&#7899;i m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; &#273;&aacute;ng tin c&#7853;y c&#7911;a nh&#7919;ng ng&#432;&#7901;i c&oacute; c&ugrave;ng ch&iacute; h&#432;&#7899;ng, v&agrave; s&#7869; c&ugrave;ng nhau gi&uacute;p &#273;&#7905; nhau &#273;&#7875; ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!--First Section End--><!--Separator Start-->

<div class="separator-sec section" id="separator">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-12 align-self-center">
<div class="section-separator">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!--Separator End--><!--Second Section Start-->

<div class="stat-sec section" id="stat">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 align-self-center">
<div class="stat-sec-text">
<div class="section-heading">
<h2>T&#7893; ch&#7913;c K&#7871;t n&#7889;i l&#7899;n nh&#7845;t To&agrave;n c&#7847;u</h2>
</div>

<div class="lineleft">&nbsp;</div>

<div class="section-text">
<p>&#272;&#432;&#7907;c th&agrave;nh l&#7853;p v&agrave;o th&aacute;ng 1 n&#259;m 1985, BNI l&agrave; t&#7893; ch&#7913;c k&#7871;t n&#7889;i kinh doanh h&agrave;ng &#273;&#7847;u v&agrave; th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng tr&ecirc;n th&#7871; gi&#7899;i, &#273;ang gi&uacute;p cho c&aacute;c doanh nghi&#7879;p t&#7915; 78 qu&#7889;c gia v&#7899;i h&#417;n 11,800+ Chapters ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n doanh nghi&#7879;p c&#7911;a m&igrave;nh.</p>

<h4>BNI ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng v&#7899;i c&aacute;ch th&#7913;c nh&#432; th&#7871; n&agrave;o ?</h4>

<p>G&oacute;i Th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n BNI cung c&#7845;p m&ocirc;i tr&#432;&#7901;ng, s&#7921; &#273;&agrave;o t&#7841;o v&agrave; h&#7895; tr&#7907; ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p &#273;&#7875; x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng c&aacute;c m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; uy t&iacute;n nh&#7857;m ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n doanh nghi&#7879;p c&#7911;a b&#7841;n. Nh&#7919;ng cu&#7897;c h&#7885;p v&#7899;i c&aacute;c &#273;&#7889;i t&aacute;c kinh doanh uy t&iacute;n h&agrave;ng tu&#7847;n theo m&#7897;t l&#7883;ch tr&igrave;nh v&#7899;i c&#7845;u tr&uacute;c &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c nghi&ecirc;n c&#7913;u &#273;&#7875; t&#7889;i &#273;a h&oacute;a c&aacute;c C&#417; h&#7897;i kinh doanh c&#7911;a b&#7841;n.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

