<div class="benefit-sec section" id="about">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 align-self-center">
<div class="section-heading">
<h2>L&#7907;i &iacute;ch khi tham d&#7921; BNI</h2>
</div>

<div class="lineCenter" style="margin-top:-25px;">&nbsp;</div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 align-self-center">
<div class="center-image"><img alt="Scale Your Business" src="../img/site/68599e6db6a52c002e19415a.jpg"></div>

<h4 class="bg-img-title">M&#7903; r&#7897;ng doanh nghi&#7879;p c&#7911;a b&#7841;n</h4>

<div class="section-text">
<p>"Tham gia BNI l&agrave; m&#7897;t m&#7841;ng l&#432;&#7899;i k&#7871;t n&#7889;i kinh doanh hi&#7879;u qu&#7843;! Gi&aacute; tr&#7883; c&#7889;t l&otilde;i c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i - Givers Gain&reg; - gi&uacute;p k&#7871;t n&#7889;i c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n &#273;&#7875; h&#7895; tr&#7907; s&#7921; ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n c&#7911;a doanh nghi&#7879;p qua vi&#7879;c cung c&#7845;p nh&#7919;ng gi&#7899;i thi&#7879;u v&agrave; c&#417; h&#7897;i ch&#7845;t l&#432;&#7907;ng.</p>

<p>Tham gia m&#7897;t cu&#7897;c h&#7885;p chi nh&aacute;nh l&agrave; c&aacute;ch t&#7889;t nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7875; tr&#7843;i nghi&#7879;m tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p s&#7913;c m&#7841;nh c&#7911;a m&#7897;t m&#7841;ng l&#432;&#7899;i doanh nghi&#7879;p &#273;&aacute;ng tin c&#7853;y v&agrave; t&igrave;m hi&#7875;u c&aacute;ch BNI c&oacute; th&#7875; thay &#273;&#7893;i t&#432;&#417;ng lai c&#7911;a doanh nghi&#7879;p b&#7841;n khi g&#7863;p g&#7905; nh&#7919;ng chuy&ecirc;n gia doanh nghi&#7879;p ch&#7845;t l&#432;&#7907;ng trong khu v&#7921;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n."</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 align-self-center">
<div class="center-image"><img alt="Cultivate Business Relationships" src="../img/site/68599e6d7a811100135c4b86.jpg"></div>

<h4 class="bg-img-title">Ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; kinh doanh</h4>

<div class="section-text">
<p>"Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng nh&#7919;ng m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; &#273;&aacute;ng tin c&#7853;y. G&oacute;i Th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n BNI gi&uacute;p b&#7841;n ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n nh&#7919;ng m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; kinh doanh l&acirc;u d&agrave;i, &#273;&#432;&#7907;c x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng tr&ecirc;n n&#7873;n t&#7843;ng v&#7919;ng ch&#7855;c c&#7911;a c&aacute;c gi&aacute; tr&#7883; c&#7889;t l&otilde;i &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ki&#7875;m ch&#7913;ng qua th&#7901;i gian."</p>

<p>M&#7895;i th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n trong m&#7841;ng l&#432;&#7899;i kinh doanh chuy&ecirc;n nghi&#7879;p c&#7911;a b&#7841;n &#273;&#7873;u g&oacute;p ph&#7847;n v&agrave;o th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng c&#7911;a b&#7841;n, v&agrave; b&#7841;n c&#361;ng g&oacute;p ph&#7847;n v&agrave;o th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng c&#7911;a h&#7885;."</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 align-self-center">
<div class="center-image"><img alt="Become a Master Connector" src="../img/site/68599e6db6a52c002c1fba94.jpg"></div>

<div class="mobile-view">
<h4 class="bg-img-title">Tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh m&#7897;t B&#7853;c th&#7847;y K&#7871;t n&#7889;i</h4>
</div>

<div class="desktop-view">
<h4 class="bg-img-title">Tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh m&#7897;t B&#7853;c th&#7847;y K&#7871;t n&#7889;i</h4>
</div>

<div class="section-text">
<p>T&#432; c&aacute;ch th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n BNI cho ph&eacute;p b&#7841;n ti&#7871;p c&#7853;n v&#7899;i c&aacute;c c&#7889; v&#7845;n, chuy&ecirc;n gia v&#7873; m&#7841;ng l&#432;&#7899;i v&agrave; nhi&#7873;u ngu&#7891;n l&#7921;c ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n chuy&ecirc;n m&ocirc;n th&ocirc;ng qua n&#7873;n t&#7843;ng BNI Academy, gi&uacute;p b&#7841;n n&acirc;ng cao k&#7929; n&#259;ng v&agrave; v&#432;&#7907;t tr&#7897;i h&#417;n so v&#7899;i &#273;&#7889;i th&#7911; c&#7841;nh tranh.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
