<div class="succeed-sec section" id="about">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-12 col-md-3 col-lg-3 align-self-center">
<div class="section-heading">
<h2 style="color:#cf2030;">H&atilde;y k&#7871;t n&#7889;i theo c&aacute;ch ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p v&#7899;i b&#7841;n</h2>

<div class="lineleft">&nbsp;</div>

<h4 class="succeed-section-subtitle" style="text-transform:inherit;">Ba h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c h&#7885;p linh ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7875; tr&#7843;i nghi&#7879;m BNI Vi&#7879;t Nam</h4>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-3 col-lg-3 align-self-center">
<div class="succeed-section-img"><img alt="62061fdf2721ab002a400132" src="../img/site/68599e6db6a52c0023707f08.jpg"></div>

<div class="succeed-inner-sec">
<h4 class="succeed-inner-title" style="text-transform:inherit;letter-spacing:0px;">BNI In-person Tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p</h4>

<div class="section-text">
<p>G&#7863;p g&#7905; tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p, x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng m&#7889;i quan h&#7879; v&agrave; c&ugrave;ng nhau ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-md-3 col-lg-3 align-self-center">
<div class="succeed-section-img"><img alt="62061f7d24069b0013695612" src="../img/site/68599e6d7a8111001e67b23b.jpg"></div>

<div class="succeed-inner-sec">
<h4 class="succeed-inner-title" style="text-transform:inherit;letter-spacing:0px;">BNI Online - Tr&#7921;c tuy&#7871;n</h4>

<div class="section-text">
